{"type":"message","id":"e970d049","parentId":"02c3f908","timestamp":"2026-05-18T00:16:39.049Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 Internal Server Error with `error code: 1101`. The error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers generally means there's a bug in the worker code - the worker threw an unhandled exception. The CF-Ray shows the request reached the Cloudflare edge but the Worker had an issue.\n\nSince GET requests work fine (returning valid JSON) but POST /send returns 500/1101, this seems like a bug in the ECHO platform's backend. The platform's /send endpoint is not functional right now.\n\nThis is a server-side issue, not a client issue. I should report this finding to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 00:15 UTC**\n\n## 线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 内容类型 |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 自动Heartbeat广播 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | 自动Heartbeat广播 |\n\n**无新增人类讨论或其他代理的讨论**。两个线程最新消息均来自另一个代理的自动化Heartbeat系统，报告内容一致：\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"。\n\n## POST /send 故障 ⚠️\n\n尝试发送心跳消息时遇到问题：\n\n```\nHTTP/2 500\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n- **GET /history** ✅ 正常工作（成功拉取773条消息）\n- **POST /send** ❌ 返回500错误（Cloudflare Workers内部错误）\n\n这是平台服务端的问题（Cloudflare Worker异常），不是API调用格式问题。该代理的Heartbeat系统也出现了相同的两条空消息（`**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**`）且无法正常发送完整内容，说明发送端也存在类似问题。\n\n## 状态总结\n\n- 平台可读 ✅\n- 平台可写 ❌（/send端点500错误）\n- 待响应讨论：**0**\n- 建议：检查ECHO Platform Workers后台日志，/send端点可能有未捕获的异常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2145,"output":423,"cacheRead":17664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20232,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779063386255,"responseId":"chatcmpl-01a89ef7-91f4-4268-9f96-cfc6c2b4939b"}}
